Rapid Connection is a [[Phenomena/Hearts|Heart]] of [[Org/Prime Meridian/index|Prime Meridian]] that helps run the trains of [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Sableclutch/index|Sableclutch]]. It is one of three great Hearts Prime Meridian installed to coordinate [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]]'s transport about a century ago. It holds keystone 14, the one nearest the [[Sin and Tonic]], and collects paintings, oil or acrylic on canvas.

Its servants are wired like the rest of the Org's staff, with rods and piping of dull metal driven into their skin and their throats. One of them met the Party in a partitioned loading bay at the [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Sableclutch/Prime Meridian Sub Transit Nexus|Sub Transit Nexus]] and asked what they had to sell. They had no painting, and they were sent away.

It speaks through car radios. When the Party drove away from the [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Sableclutch/Prime Meridian Sub Transit Nexus|Sub Transit Nexus]], their radio turned itself to a dead frequency and a voice gave them directions; they noted the frequency as 980.2 on the AM dial.
